OL,3,GNEWSAGang members jailed for plotting
OL,4,Ato kill drugs boss lose appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo crime gang members who were jailed
OL,7,Ffor a murder plot have lost an appeal
OL,8,Fto reduce their prison sentences.
OL,10,FLast year, crime boss David Nisbet, 36,
OL,11,Fwas jailed for 13 years and Declan
OL,12,FMcCuish for 11 years for conspiring to
OL,13,Fkill gangster Ryan Carvill in 2020.
OL,15,FThe assassination attempt failed when a
OL,16,Fpotential hitman pulled out at the last
OL,17,Fminute and the group were caught after
OL,18,Fincriminating messages on the encrypted
OL,19,FEncroChat phone network linked them to
OL,20,Fthe crime.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
