OL,3,GNEWSAGang members jailed for plotting
OL,4,Ato kill drugs boss lose appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree appeal judges at the Court of
OL,7,FCriminal Appeal in Edinburgh ruled the
OL,8,Fsentences as correct and said they did
OL,9,Fnot breach legal guidelines.
